<title>USA: Wachovia Corp Q4 diluted shr rises.</title>
<headline>Wachovia Corp Q4 diluted shr rises.</headline>
<dateline>WINSTON-SALEM, N.C. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$1.02		    $0.85</p>
<p> Net			170,700		  146,200</p>
<p>		 Year</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$3.80		    $3.49</p>
<p> Net			644,600		  602,500</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - Q4 provision for loan losses $47.4 million versus $30.1 million.  Provision for loan losses for the full year 1996 was $149.9 million versus $103.8 million in 1995.</p>
<p>Net loan losses totaled $47.4 million for the quarter, or 0.61 percent of average loans, versus $30 million, or 0.42 percent, for the same period in the prior year.</p>
<p>((-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
